<title>HONG KONG: Merrill sets warrants on HK property stocks.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on HK property stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it had issued 500 million American-style call warrants on a basket of five property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Great Eagle Holdings Ltd		0.05 shares</p>
<p> HKR International Ltd		   0.1  shares</p>
<p> Hysan Development Co Ltd		0.1  shares</p>
<p> Wharf (Holdings) Ltd		    0.05 shares</p>
<p> Wheelock and Co Ltd		     0.1  shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$8.2769	PREMIUM	 11.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.1464	GEARING	 6x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   27.MAR.98	PAYDATE	 18.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  19.JUN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$8.7125	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
